<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Good Morning/Afternoon,<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight about your pets travel<br />
<br />
The selected flights chosen travel during the hottest parts of the day, and due to our extreme weather policy are not available. Our policy has been implemented to ensure the safety and well-being of your pets. Qantas Freight refrains from transporting any animals when the expected temperature exceeds 35°C or drops below 5°C.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
To avoid the hottest parts of the day, we recommend booking early morning or late afternoon/evening services.<br />
<br />
We thank you for understanding our suppression policy for the safety of your pet's travel.</body>
